# Working directory for screenshots on their way to R2.
#
# Once ship:ingest has run, the bytes live in R2 and the row lives in `media`,
# so these local files are a staging copy and nothing more. They are also large:
# a full-page PNG of the homepage is around 5 MB before conversion.
#
# The ledger, the shipped log and the style guide are the durable part of ship/
# and are tracked normally.
*
!.gitignore
